WEBVTT

00:31:58.865 --> 00:32:05.197
I'm going to say also a bigger point
beyond office spaces, which is:

00:32:05.221 --> 00:32:08.714
I think people often
think that I'm saying,

00:32:08.738 --> 00:32:12.953
no one should ever
be uncomfortable anytime, ever.

00:32:12.977 --> 00:32:17.911
And I'm actually a huge believer in people
stepping outside their comfort zones

00:32:17.935 --> 00:32:19.722
and doing the stuff that's difficult.

00:32:19.746 --> 00:32:22.475
And in fact, you know,
I would never have given a TED Talk

00:32:22.499 --> 00:32:23.999
if I didn't believe that.

00:32:24.023 --> 00:32:28.471
But I believe in doing that
really strategically.

00:32:28.495 --> 00:32:32.130
CA: Talk about that talk,
because this is another riddle, really.